    "updated_at": "2015-08-03T22:08:51Z",
    "body": "Are you trying to link to the URL spec itself, or to the definition of URL in the URL spec?  For the former, use a biblio link.  For the latter, I just put URL in the Shepherd database, so it wouldn't have been usable previously, but should hopefully now work.  (I haven't tried it out yet.)\n\nFor the second one, which biblio entry are you referring to, exactly?  There is such a line underneath the \"type\" biblio entry - there are a lot of definitions for the term \"type\", so it provides a sublist for all of the definitions with a disambiguator, which is what you're seeing.\n",
